  "docs": [
    "Oracle-priced escrow swaps between WSOL and USDC.",
    "",
    "A depositor escrows one asset in a PDA-owned vault. Any taker can fill the whole offer by",
    "paying the other asset at the current Chainlink SOL / USD price."
